{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42806","headline":"初至郡界 · 刘兼","name":"初至郡界","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉陵江畔接荣川，两畔旌旗下濑船。\n郡印已分炎瘴地，朝衣犹惹御炉烟。\n莲塘小饮香随艇，月榭高吟水压天。\n锦字莫嫌归路远，华夷一统太平年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}